  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "p": "Twelve treasures stand about Nightfall's lands: Buried Treasure, Treasure Chests, and two marked {why:Do Not Touch|Several hidden Immolated or Ruby Djinn pop up when it's opened; spread the party out first, their area damage hurts.}. No key needed; each gives a weapon, a salvage item or a gem and some gold, from around 500 in Istan to around 3,000 in the Realm of Torment. Once in about {why:30 days|Opening it sooner gives nothing, and seems to start the wait again; so does taking any treasure, for every chest of that character's.} a character, and the rewards {why:shrink|After a good number of treasures opened by a character, the gold falls towards about a fifth of the first value (100 in Istan, 700 in the Realm of Torment) and the items turn purple; well-documented, not fully understood.} the more a character has opened."
        }
      ]
    },
